How I Live Now is a 2013 romantic speculative drama film based on
the 2004 novel of the same name by Meg Rosoff.

11
01:01:43,333 --> 01:01:49,333
It was directed by Kevin Macdonald, written by Tony Grisoni, Jeremy Brock and Penelope Skinner while starring
Saoirse Ronan, George MacKay, Tom Holland, Harley Bird, Anna Chancellor and  Corey Johnson.

12
01:07:20,000 --> 01:07:26,000
The film centres around American teenager, Daisy (Ronan) and her British cousins, Eddie (MacKay), Isaac
(Holland), and Piper (Bird), as they try to reunite during an apocalyptic nuclear war.

13
01:12:56,666 --> 01:13:02,666
The film premiered at the 2013 Toronto International Film Festival and received mixed reviews, with some critics
positively comparing Ronan's role to Jennifer Lawrence's role as Katniss Everdeen in The Hunger Games.

14
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:39,333
The film was nominated for multiple awards across various categories including Ronan
being nominated for a British Independent Film Award and a Saturn Award.

15
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:16,000
Macdonald, MacKay and Bird also received various nominations.

16
01:29:46,666 --> 01:29:52,666
The film explores themes of countryside, based on novel or book,
post-apocalyptic future, survival, terrorism.

17
01:35:23,333 --> 01:35:29,333
The tone is emotional and intense.
